> 
>     alsactl -f /tmp/foo store
> alsactl: get_control:202: Cannot read control'2,0,0,Digital In Playback 
> Source,0': Invalid argument
> alsactl: get_control:202: Cannot read control '2,0,0,3D Stereo Extender 
